{"Welcome — three ways to open":"<div class=\"dv-opts\">\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1a\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1a\">1a</a>Photography. The site's hero subject, fading into ivory. Sign-in is on the first screen — no carousel.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Welcome 1a\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;position:relative;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:560px;background:#EDE3D6;overflow:hidden\">\n    <img src=\"assets/hero-a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 0%\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(251,248,244,0) 55%,#FBF8F4 100%)\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:relative;padding:64px 24px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n    <span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline\">keel<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.28em;height:.28em;border-radius:50%;background:#C08E82;margin-left:.14em\"></span></span>\n    <a href=\"#1e\" style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#3B322C;background:rgba(251,248,244,.85);padding:9px 14px;border-radius:999px\">Log in</a>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:relative;margin-top:auto;padding:0 24px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:40px;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">Finally.</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span> Strength &amp; nutrition that works for women</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B\">Eat enough protein. Build muscle. Feel stronger for the years ahead.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:4px\">\n      <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF8F4;display:inline-block\"></span>Continue with Apple</button>\n      <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#3B322C;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:1px solid #DED2C1;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#EDE3D6;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;font-weight:600;font-size:12px\">G</span>Continue with Google</button>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6D6157;text-align:center\">7-day free trial. No goal weight, ever. Cancel in two taps.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1b\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1b\">1b</a>Coach-led carousel. The robot introduces the three ideas; dots are tappable. Sign-in follows on <a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1d\">1d</a>.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Welcome 1b\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 24px 40px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n    <span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline\">keel<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.28em;height:.28em;border-radius:50%;background:#C08E82;margin-left:.14em\"></span></span>\n    <button onClick=\"{{ skipIntro }}\" style=\"font:400 15px 'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#6D6157;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0\">Skip</button>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:28px;background:#EDE3D6;border-radius:28px;height:340px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;left:-40px;top:-60px;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:#F9F2EC\"></div>\n    <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"Keel coach\" style=\"position:relative;width:250px;height:250px;object-fit:contain;margin-bottom:-6px;animation:kl-float 4s ease-in-out infinite\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:22px;right:22px;background:#fff;border-radius:18px 18px 18px 4px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;max-width:190px;box-shadow:0 14px 30px -24px rgba(59,50,44,.5)\">{{ introBubble }}</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:28px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">{{ introHeadPre }} <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">{{ introHeadEm }}</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span></h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B;text-wrap:pretty\">{{ introBody }}</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;margin:16px 0 20px\">\n    <sc-for list=\"{{ introDots }}\" as=\"d\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\">\n      <button onClick=\"{{ d.go }}\" style=\"width:{{ d.w }};height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:{{ d.bg }};border:0;padding:0;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s\"></button>\n    </sc-for>\n  </div>\n  <button onClick=\"{{ nextIntro }}\" style=\"height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\">{{ introCta }}</button>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1c\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1c\">1c</a>Ink. The wordmark at full scale, apricot dot, one live stat card. Quietest and most confident of the three.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" dark=\"{{ true }}\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Welcome 1c\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#3B322C;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#FBF8F4;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 24px 40px;box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;overflow:hidden\">\n  <div style=\"margin-top:56px;font-weight:600;font-size:118px;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:.9;display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline\">keel<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.24em;height:.24em;border-radius:50%;background:#F0C9A8;margin-left:.12em\"></span></div>\n  <p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#D8CCBF;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-wrap:pretty\">Your strength &amp; nutrition coach <span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;color:#FBF8F4\">after 40.</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:auto;background:#463C34;border-radius:20px;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline\">\n      <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#C2A894\">Protein today</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#C2A894\">of 110g</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:42px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">62<span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:500;margin-left:2px;color:#D8CCBF\">g</span></div>\n    <div style=\"height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#574C44;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"width:56%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;animation:kl-grow .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)\"></div></div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#D8CCBF\">48g short. Most women are — that gap is what the plan is built around.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:24px\">\n    <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#FBF8F4;color:#3B322C;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#3B322C;display:inline-block\"></span>Continue with Apple</button>\n    <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:1px solid #574C44;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#574C44;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;font-weight:600;font-size:12px\">G</span>Continue with Google</button>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;color:#D8CCBF\">Already have a plan? <a href=\"#1e\" style=\"color:#F0C9A8;font-weight:500\">Log in</a></p>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n</div>","Sign up and log in":"<div class=\"dv-opts\">\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1d\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1d\">1d</a>Sign-up sheet. Follows the carousel; the coach card stays visible above so the screen doesn't go cold.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Sign up 1d\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#EDE3D6;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;overflow:hidden\">\n  <div style=\"padding:64px 24px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n    <span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline\">keel<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.28em;height:.28em;border-radius:50%;background:#C08E82;margin-left:.14em\"></span></span>\n  </div>\n  <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:210px;height:210px;object-fit:contain;margin:26px auto 0;display:block\">\n  <div style=\"margin-top:auto;background:#FBF8F4;border-radius:30px 30px 0 0;padding:28px 24px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;box-shadow:0 -18px 40px -28px rgba(59,50,44,.4)\">\n    <div style=\"width:36px;height:4px;border-radius:999px;background:#E6DCCE;margin:-8px auto 0\"></div>\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-size:30px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600\">Create your account</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:-6px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B\">It keeps your plan safe across phones and starts your 7-day free trial.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n      <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF8F4;display:inline-block\"></span>Continue with Apple</button>\n      <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#3B322C;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:1px solid #DED2C1;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#EDE3D6;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;font-weight:600;font-size:12px\">G</span>Continue with Google</button>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6D6157;text-align:center;text-wrap:pretty\">By continuing you agree to the <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#A85A3C;font-weight:500\">Terms</a> and <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#A85A3C;font-weight:500\">Privacy policy</a>. Your health answers are never used for marketing.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14.5px;text-align:center;color:#5D534B\">Already have a plan? <a href=\"#1e\" style=\"color:#A85A3C;font-weight:500\">Log in</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1e\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1e\">1e</a>Log in. Same two buttons, plus the \"I signed up on the web\" magic-link path the spec requires.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Log in 1e\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 24px 40px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n    <a href=\"#1a\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#EDE3D6;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3B322C;margin-left:-8px\"><span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border:solid #3B322C;border-width:0 0 2px 2px;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-left:3px\"></span></a>\n    <span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline\">keel<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.28em;height:.28em;border-radius:50%;background:#C08E82;margin-left:.14em\"></span></span>\n    <span style=\"width:44px\"></span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:36px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">Welcome <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">back.</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span></h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B\">Your plan, targets and history are exactly where you left them.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:36px\">\n    <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#FBF8F4;display:inline-block\"></span>Continue with Apple</button>\n    <button style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#3B322C;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:1px solid #DED2C1;cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#EDE3D6;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;font-weight:600;font-size:12px\">G</span>Continue with Google</button>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:28px 0\"><span style=\"flex:1;height:1px;background:#E6DCCE\"></span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6D6157\">or</span><span style=\"flex:1;height:1px;background:#E6DCCE\"></span></div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F6F1E9;border-radius:22px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em\">I signed up on the web</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5D534B\">Enter the email you paid with. We'll send a one-tap link — your plan is already waiting.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:4px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;height:48px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DCCE;padding:0 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:15px;color:#7D7167\">you@example.com</div>\n      <button style=\"height:48px;padding:0 20px;border-radius:999px;background:#A85A3C;color:#fff;font:500 15px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap\">Send link</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:auto 0 0;font-size:14.5px;text-align:center;color:#5D534B\">New here? <a href=\"#1d\" style=\"color:#A85A3C;font-weight:500\">Create an account</a></p>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1f\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1f\">1f</a>Magic link sent. The waiting state — coach keeps her company, the email is echoed back, resend after a pause.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Check email 1f\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 24px 40px;box-sizing:border-box;align-items:center;text-align:center\">\n  <div style=\"align-self:flex-start\"><a href=\"#1e\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#EDE3D6;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-left:-8px\"><span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border:solid #3B322C;border-width:0 0 2px 2px;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-left:3px\"></span></a></div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:56px;width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:44px;background:#EDE3D6;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative\">\n    <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:170px;height:170px;object-fit:contain\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;right:-10px;top:-10px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#9AA88F;display:grid;place-items:center;animation:kl-tick .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) .3s both\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:7px;border:solid #fff;border-width:0 0 2.5px 2.5px;transform:rotate(-45deg) translateY(-2px)\"></span></div>\n  </div>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:32px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">Check your <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">inbox.</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span></h1>\n  <p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B;text-wrap:pretty\">We sent a sign-in link to<br><b style=\"color:#3B322C;font-weight:500\">sarah.m@gmail.com</b>. Tap it on this phone and your plan opens straight away.</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:28px;background:#F6F1E9;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5D534B;text-align:left;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\">\n    <span style=\"flex:none;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8C05F;margin-top:6px\"></span>\n    <span>The link works for 15 minutes. Nothing in the inbox? Check spam, or resend below.</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;width:100%\">\n    <button style=\"height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:#3B322C;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:1px solid #DED2C1;cursor:pointer\">Resend link</button>\n    <a href=\"#1e\" style=\"font-size:14.5px;color:#A85A3C;font-weight:500;padding:8px\">Use a different email</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n</div>","Quiz — one question per screen, visible progress":"<div class=\"dv-opts\">\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1g\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1g\">1g</a>Q1, single-select. Opens with the goal, never height and weight. Tap to select — 2px ink border marks the choice.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Quiz Q1 1g\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 20px 40px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\">\n    <a href=\"#1d\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-left:-8px\"><span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border:solid #3B322C;border-width:0 0 2px 2px;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-left:3px\"></span></a>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:#EDE3D6;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"width:8%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82\"></div></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6D6157;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:40px;text-align:right\">1 of 12</span>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:36px 0 0;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:17px;color:#6D6157\">Let's start with you</p>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">What's your main goal right now?</h1>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n    <sc-for list=\"{{ goals }}\" as=\"g\" hint-placeholder-count=\"5\">\n      <button onClick=\"{{ g.pick }}\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-align:left;padding:{{ g.pad }};border-radius:18px;background:{{ g.bg }};border:{{ g.border }};cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;transition:all .15s\">\n        <span style=\"flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:{{ g.tile }};display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"{{ g.icon }}\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:cover\"></span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3\">{{ g.label }}</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:{{ g.ring }};background:{{ g.ringBg }};display:grid;place-items:center\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ g.dotBg }}\"></span></span>\n      </button>\n    </sc-for>\n  </div>\n  <button style=\"margin-top:auto;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\">Continue</button>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1h\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1h\">1h</a>Q4, multi-select as chips. Honey marks a selected chip (habits colour), ink text throughout. Tap to toggle.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Quiz Q4 1h\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 20px 40px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\">\n    <a href=\"#1g\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-left:-8px\"><span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border:solid #3B322C;border-width:0 0 2px 2px;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-left:3px\"></span></a>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:#EDE3D6;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"width:33%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82\"></div></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6D6157;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:40px;text-align:right\">4 of 12</span>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:36px 0 0;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:17px;color:#6D6157\">Pick as many as fit</p>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">What's changed for you in the last few years?</h1>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\">\n    <sc-for list=\"{{ changes }}\" as=\"c\" hint-placeholder-count=\"7\">\n      <button onClick=\"{{ c.pick }}\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:{{ c.pad }};border-radius:999px;background:{{ c.bg }};border:{{ c.border }};cursor:pointer;font:500 15.5px 'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;transition:all .15s\">\n        <span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ c.dot }}\"></span>{{ c.label }}\n      </button>\n    </sc-for>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:32px;background:#F6F1E9;border-radius:18px;padding:16px 18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start\">\n    <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:40px;height:40px;object-fit:contain;flex:none;margin-top:-2px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#3B322C\">{{ changesNote }}</p>\n  </div>\n  <button style=\"margin-top:auto;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\">Continue</button>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1i\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1i\">1i</a>Insight card after Q11. The teaching moment — the protein number does the talking; rose-clay owns protein.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Insight 1i\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#F9F2EC;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 20px 40px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\">\n    <span style=\"width:44px;height:44px;margin-left:-8px\"></span>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:#EFE2DA;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"width:66%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82\"></div></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#6D6157;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:40px;text-align:right\">8 of 12</span>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:36px 0 0;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:17px;color:#6D6157\">Something worth knowing</p>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">After 40, your body needs <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">more</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span> protein, not less</h1>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:28px;background:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px\">\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#6D6157\">You said you eat about</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">60<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:500;color:#6D6157\">g</span></span>\n        <div style=\"height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#EDE3D6;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px\"><div style=\"width:55%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#A8968A\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#6D6157\">Women your age need about</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#C08E82\">110<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:500;color:#6D6157\">g</span></span>\n        <div style=\"height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#EDE3D6;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;animation:kl-grow 1s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B;text-wrap:pretty\">Muscle becomes less responsive to protein as oestrogen falls, so the same meal builds less. Eating \"healthily\" isn't the fix — eating enough is.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\">\n    <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:52px;height:52px;object-fit:contain;flex:none\">\n    <div style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:18px 18px 18px 4px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45\">Don't worry about the gap yet. That's my job — I'll close it a meal at a time.</div>\n  </div>\n  <button style=\"margin-top:auto;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\">Got it</button>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n</div>","Building your plan → the reveal":"<div class=\"dv-opts\">\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1j\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1j\">1j</a>Analysis moment. Status lines tick in on a stagger; olive means done. One credibility line, no fabricated numbers.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Building plan 1j\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 24px 40px;box-sizing:border-box;align-items:center;text-align:center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:180px;height:180px;object-fit:contain;margin-top:40px;animation:kl-float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite\">\n  <h1 style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600\">Building your <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">plan</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span></h1>\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15px;color:#5D534B\">About twenty seconds.</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:36px;width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DCCE;border-radius:22px;padding:8px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;text-align:left\">\n    <sc-for list=\"{{ buildSteps }}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:{{ s.rule }};animation:kl-in .6s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) {{ s.delay }} both\">\n        <span style=\"flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ s.dotBg }};display:grid;place-items:center;animation:kl-tick .45s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) {{ s.tickDelay }} both\"><span style=\"width:9px;height:5px;border:solid #fff;border-width:0 0 2px 2px;transform:rotate(-45deg) translateY(-1px)\"></span></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:{{ s.color }}\">{{ s.label }}</span>\n      </div>\n    </sc-for>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:auto;background:#F6F1E9;border-radius:18px;padding:16px 20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5D534B;text-wrap:pretty\">Targets follow the British Dietetic Association and NHS guidance for women over 40, and the plan can't produce an unsafe number.</div>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1k\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1k\">1k</a>Plan reveal. Leads with the protein gap, echoes her Q25 answer, no weight projection. Same card as the site's \"How it works\".</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Plan reveal 1k\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#FBF8F4;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 20px 0;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden\">\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:17px;color:#6D6157\">Ready</p>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:34px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600\">Sarah, here's your <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">plan.</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span></h1>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:22px;background:#FBF3EA;border-radius:22px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7D7167\">Your daily targets</span>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7D7167\">Protein</span><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#C08E82\">110<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#6D6157\">g</span></span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7D7167\">Strength</span><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#C2714F\">3<span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#6D6157;letter-spacing:0\"> × a week</span></span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7D7167\">Fibre</span><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">30<span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#6D6157\">g</span></span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7D7167\">Steps</span><span style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">8,000</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"height:1px;background:#EFE2DA\"></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7D7167\">Where you are now</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5D534B\">about 62g a day</span></div>\n    <div style=\"height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#EFE2DA;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"width:56%;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;animation:kl-grow 1s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)\"></div></div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#3B322C\">56% of your target. This gap is the single biggest thing holding back your strength and energy — your first week is built around closing it.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px\">\n    <div style=\"background:#F4F6F1;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#6D6157\">Starting programme</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.2\">Strength training</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5D534B\">Dumbbells at home · 25 min</span></div>\n    <div style=\"background:#E3DAEF;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#6D6157\">Tracking for you</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.2\">Sleep &amp; energy</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5D534B\">Perimenopause-aware</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start\">\n    <img src=\"assets/coach.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:contain;flex:none\">\n    <div style=\"background:#F6F1E9;border-radius:18px 18px 18px 4px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45\">You said success in 12 weeks looks like <i style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif\">\"carrying the shopping up the stairs without stopping.\"</i> Noted. That's what we're building toward.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding:16px 0 40px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(251,248,244,0),#FBF8F4 30%)\">\n    <button style=\"width:100%;height:52px;border-radius:999px;background:#3B322C;color:#FBF8F4;font:500 16px 'Outfit',sans-serif;border:0;cursor:pointer\">Start my plan</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</x-import></div>\n</div>","Paywall — trial start":"<div class=\"dv-opts\">\n\n<div class=\"dv-opt\" id=\"1l\"><div class=\"dv-olabel\"><a class=\"dv-oid\" href=\"#1l\">1l</a>Cards. Annual pre-selected with the Save 69% badge, per-week comparison on both, renewal terms in ink at 13.5px, Restore purchases. Tap a plan.</div>\n<x-import component-from-global-scope=\"IOSDevice\" from=\"./ios-frame.jsx\" hint-size=\"402px,874px\">\n<div data-screen-label=\"Paywall 1l\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;background:#EDE3D6;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:64px 20px 32px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n    <span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline\">keel<span style=\"display:inline-block;width:.28em;height:.28em;border-radius:50%;background:#C08E82;margin-left:.14em\"></span></span>\n    <button style=\"font:500 14px 'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#5D534B;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0\">Restore purchases</button>\n  </div>\n  <h1 style=\"margin:28px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:pretty\">Your 110g protein target starts <span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column\"><span style=\"font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0\">today.</span><span style=\"height:3px;border-radius:999px;background:#C08E82;margin-top:2px\"></span></span></h1>\n  <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#5D534B\">7-day free trial of everything — the AI coach, photo meal scans, your weekly report. Nothing held back.</p>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n    <sc-for list=\"{{ plans }}\" as=\"p\" hint-placeholder-count=\"2\">\n      <button onClick=\"{{ p.pick }}\" style=\"position:relative;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:{{ p.border }};padding:{{ p.pad }};border-radius:22px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:4px 16px;align-items:center\">\n        <sc-if value=\"{{ p.badge }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:-13px;left:22px;background:#A85A3C;color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;line-height:1\">Save 69%</span></sc-if>\n        <span style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em\">{{ p.name }}</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right\">{{ p.price }}</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#5D534B\">{{ p.sub }}</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#5D534B;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">{{ p.perWeek }}</span>\n      </button>\n    </sc-for>\n    <button onClick=\"{{ pickMonthly }}\" style=\"text-align:left;background:transparent;border:{{ monthlyBorder }};padding:14px 22px;border-radius:18px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;color:#3B322C;displa